<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>About Us - Travel & Tourism</title>
  <style>
    /* Reset and base */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      background: #f0f4f8;
      color: #2e3a59;
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding-top: 70px; /* header space */
    }

    /* Header placeholder */
    .fixed {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%;
      background: #ffffffdd;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      z-index: 999;
      backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(8px);
    }

    /* Hero section with subtle animated gradient text */
    .hero {
      width: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #6a11cb 0%, #2575fc 100%);
      padding: 5rem 1rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 90%, 0% 100%);
      box-shadow: inset 0 -60px 80px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }
    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ffb347, #ffcc33);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      animation: gradientShift 5s ease infinite alternate;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      max-width: 600px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    @keyframes gradientShift {
      0% {
        background-position: 0% 50%;
      }
      100% {
        background-position: 100% 50%;
      }
    }

    /* Container */
    .container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      width: 90%;
      margin: 4rem auto 6rem auto;
    }

    /* About heading */
    .about h2 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      color: #334155;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      position: relative;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    /* underline effect */
    .about h2::after {
      content: '';
      width: 6rem;
      height: 4px;
      background: #ff9a3c;
      display: block;
      margin: 0.6rem auto 0 auto;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px #ff9a3c88;
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }
    .about h2:hover::after {
      width: 8rem;
    }

    .about p {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 750px;
      margin: 1rem auto 3rem auto;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: #475569;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      line-height: 1.65;
      user-select: none;
    }

    /* Features grid */
    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 2.8rem;
    }

    /* Feature card */
    .feature-card {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #e0e7ff);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 2.2rem 1.8rem;
      box-shadow:
        6px 6px 12px #bebebe,
        -6px -6px 12px #ffffff;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    /* Hover effect with subtle 3D lift */
    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-12px);
      box-shadow:
        12px 12px 20px #bebebe,
        -12px -12px 20px #ffffff;
    }
    /* Icon style */
    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #2563eb;
      user-select: none;
    }
    .feature-card p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #334155;
      user-select: text;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    /* Floating animated circles decoration on cards */
    .feature-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      width: 100px;
      height: 100px;
      background: #60a5fa33;
      border-radius: 50%;
      top: -40px;
      right: -40px;
      filter: blur(20px);
      animation: floatAround 6s ease-in-out infinite;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    /* Each card gets different animation delay */
    .feature-card:nth-child(2)::before {
      animation-delay: 2s;
      background: #a78bfa33;
    }
    .feature-card:nth-child(3)::before {
      animation-delay: 4s;
      background: #f8717133;
    }
    .feature-card:nth-child(4)::before {
      animation-delay: 1s;
      background: #34d39933;
    }

    @keyframes floatAround {
      0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) }
      50% { transform: translate(15px, 15px) }
    }

    /* Footer placeholder style */
    footer {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      background: #334155;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      user-select: none;
      box-shadow: inset 0 4px 10px #1e293bcc;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero h2 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
      .hero p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }
      .about h2 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50">
    <%- include('./partials/header') %>
  </div>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Discover, Explore, Experience</h2>
      <p>Your ultimate companion for unforgettable journeys.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about container">
    <h2>About Our Platform</h2>
    <p>
      Welcome to the Travel & Tourism Guide, your all-in-one solution for planning memorable travel experiences. 
      From historical monuments to serene beaches and breathtaking waterfalls, we bring the world closer to you.
    </p>

    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>🗺️ Place Information</h3>
        <p>Detailed info on historical places, waterfalls, beaches, and temples with directions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>🤖 Smart Chatbot</h3>
        <p>Ask anything! Our chatbot helps you find places, weather, transport and more.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>🌍 Live Map & Weather</h3>
        <p>Google Maps, transport routes, hotels, restaurants and real-time weather forecast.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>🌊 Tsunami Alerts</h3>
        <p>Beach safety matters! Stay informed with our real-time tsunami alert system.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('./partials/footer') %>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
